CODEGEN.md §4.1, DECISIONS 279(d): a fn the mode already refuses gets no E8101, one finding per cause: in types mode a package fn's result and lookup table past Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER are E8014 (types mode has no data for them) alone. No E8101 is expected.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A tone.
enum Tone { soft, loud }

/// A precomputed result.
export fn big() -> Int { return 9_007_199_254_740_993 }

/// A lookup table.
export fn per(t: Tone) -> Int { return 9_007_199_254_740_995 }

emit ts { out: "@features/a/a.ts", mode: types }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8014]  a/a.canon:7:11
  types mode cannot emit the precomputed function of big: there is no data to read it from

error[E8014]  a/a.canon:10:11
  types mode cannot emit the lookup function of per: there is no data to read it from

2 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
